	(text_box "Note that the inputs of MIC/Line-In \nare shorted to GND if no jack is pluged in. \nThat means that also the testpoints \nin_left and in_right are shorted to GND.\nIf the testpoints are used for singal input \nan empty plug must be inserted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
